    <description>
Local network coordination toolkit for proxy and VPN engines.
Supports WireGuard, XRay, Hysteria2, TUIC, Psiphon, and more.
Includes network analysis, media downloader, torrent manager, and terminal CLI.

REQUIREMENTS: Windows 10+, no Python required
    </description>
    <summary>Local proxy toolkit: engines, analysis, media, torrents, CLI</summary>
    <releaseNotes>
🔒 Security Hardening: Atomic JSON, thread-safe locking, DoH validation, SFTP safety, WinDivert verification
✨ Complete toolkit: Phase 1-4 network analysis, media/torrent manager, terminal CLI, web dashboard
🐛 42 bugs fixed across audit waves
